                                "example_id": "24aecd83-52e3-48a6-afcb-024c526da579",
                                "sense_id": "b8fddcfd-d307-36e0-ba8e-b30280529641",
                                "text": "At Malta there was a race between little sailing-boats; one boy slung his ballast under the thwart of his boat; there was a slight tumble in the sea; the boat jobbled up and down, but forged away from all the rest and won the race."
                            },
                            {
